<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How HB Distributing handles information submitted through this website."
>
  <p class="text-ink-muted leading-7">
    HB Distributing uses the details you submit on our contact, quote, and partnership forms to
    respond to your request. That includes your name, company, email, phone number, and the message
    or files you choose to send.
  </p>
  <p class="text-ink-muted leading-7">
    We do not sell that information. Questions about a submission can be sent to
    <a href="mailto:support@hbdistributing.com">support@hbdistributing.com</a>
    or by calling +1 (800) 555-0199.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
